          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Citi cuts Micron price target on peaking memory prices  Citi downgraded Micron, arguing that both DRAM and NAND prices will see QoQ gains decelerate over the next four quarters, with pricing peaking in the May (F2Q) quarter of next year.  Specifically, Citi revised its QoQ DRAM",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2085865896090992746",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-08T07:09:17.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 2023
        },
        {
          "handle": "dylan522p",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "People ask me why Micron trades at a multiple to SK Hynix now that the ADR exists. It's very simple. Corporate governance exists.",
          "url": "https://x.com/dylan522p/status/2085191620048326947",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-06T10:29:57.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 966
        },
        {
          "handle": "statementdog",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Blank 12-inch silicon wafers sell for US$60 to 70 today. Supply chain estimates now have them topping US$200 by the end of 2028.  A wafer of  $TSM  3nm chips carries about US$33,000 of output, and Micron's  $MU  DDR5 server memory runs US$50,000 to 60,000 a wafer, so even at US$200",
          "url": "https://x.com/statementdog/status/2085197868089123144",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-06T10:54:47.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 19
        },
        {
          "handle": "statementdog",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Mitsui Kinzoku (5706.T) supplies north of 90% of the carrier-attached ultra-thin copper foil that IC substrates are built on. 1.5 to 5 micron copper on a carrier, the layer you need to form fine circuits. They put the demand on data centers, memory, optical modules and AI",
          "url": "https://x.com/statementdog/status/2086708719287747012",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-10T14:58:22.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 11
